{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 WL-Sims English;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Courier New;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset0 Tahoma;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone 
\par 1. Ye servants of the Lord,
\par Each in His office wait,
\par Observant of His heavenly word,
\par And watchful at His gate.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Let all your lamps be bright,
\par And trim the golden flame;
\par Gird up your lions, as in His sight,
\par For awful is His name.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Watch: 'tis your lord's command;
\par And, while we speak, He's near;
\par Mark the first signal of His hand,
\par And ready all appear.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. O happy servant he,
\par In such employment found !
\par He shall his Lord with rapture see,
\par And be with honour crowned.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Christ shall the banquet spread
\par With His own royal hand,
\par And raise that faithful servant's head
\par Amid the angelic band.
\par \cf1\ul\f1 
\par \f2 
\par }

